  "sample": "Eight fresh independently seeded task histories conditional on one preserved receiver founder. Exploratory feasibility, not independent-founder replication.",
  "routeIntervention": "Actual saved 11-gate receiver state is extended using its existing 29-gate construction; strong cues 1\u21922\u21923. Adapted 2/7 control explicitly projects zone and replaces 2/7 outgoing gates with parameter-matched dwell and reciprocal pair.",
